WEBVTT - BRAWLVERSE EP0: IRON JAW vs VIPER (commentary subtitles)

00:00.500 --> 00:03.000
BRAWLVERSE. Season 1 sample bout.

00:03.200 --> 00:06.500
IRON JAW versus VIPER.

