He's down... he's NOT getting up!

00:37.200 --> 00:39.000
KAY-OHHH!

00:39.500 --> 00:44.000
It's over! What a finish!

00:44.200 --> 00:48.500
The crowd goes wild!

00:49.000 --> 00:52.500
BRAWLVERSE. YOU call the fight.
